  "body": "Signed-off-by: Zach Aller <zach_aller@intuit.com>\n",
  "references": [
    {
      "commit": {
        "author": "\"Zach Aller\" <code@example.com>",
        "date": "2026-10-21T07:47:30-05:00",
        "subject": "docs: re-record the demo GIF on the Promotion Explorer with a diamond DAG (#2294)",
        "body": "The dashboard replaced Overview and History with one Explorer view, so\nthe recorder's storyboard no longer matched the UI. The demo strategy is\nnow a diamond: development fans out to staging-us and staging-eu, which\nboth feed production. staging-eu soaks longer, so production visibly\nwaits for the slower branch.\n\n- record.mjs: open the promotion map, follow the new change's row\n  through the matrix, then open the production details panel. Widen the\n  viewport so all four environment columns fit.\n- demo.sh and manifests: four environments with dependsOn.\n- cluster.sh up: install the Argo CD Application CRD when missing; the\n  controller does not start without it.\n- make-gif.sh: default to 1300 px so cell text stays legible.\n- SKILL.md: new storyboard, invariants, and troubleshooting.\n- README.md, getting-started.md: alt text for the new animation.\n\nSigned-off-by: Michael Crenshaw <350466+crenshaw-dev@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
        "sha": "c78ae8af030503a693ef100d850500e67ea5167c",
        "repoUrl": "https://github.com/argoproj-labs/gitops-promoter"
      }
    }
  ]
}
